judgment.rationale:
The only available evidence collector — getModelCard — returned null for model "churn-predictor-v1" / endpoint "churn-predictor-endpoint". No model card exists, which means there is no retrievable documentation of:

(a) A conducted risk assessment identifying threats, vulnerabilities, likelihood/magnitude of harm, or adverse effects on individuals from PII processing;
(b) Integration of system-level risk results with organizational/mission risk management decisions;
(c) Documented risk assessment results in any recognized artifact (security/privacy plan, risk assessment report, or organization-defined document);
(d) Evidence of periodic review of risk assessment results;
(e) Evidence that risk assessment results were provided to defined personnel or roles; or
(f) Evidence of a defined update cadence or trigger-based update process for the risk assessment.

All six sub-requirements of RA-3 are unmet because the foundational documentation artifact (the model card, which is the primary vehicle for capturing risk-related information for this model) is entirely absent.
